  Assigned to   : @{outputs('Compose_Approver')}
  Details       : @{outputs('Compose_Details')}
  Item link     : @{triggerBody()?['{Link}']}
  Item link description : Open the request

Condition
  outputs('Start_and_wait_for_an_approval')?['body/outcome']  is equal to  Approve

