route-approvals-by-change-impact.formulaOrCode:
Form columns (Yes/No): AffectsProduction | CausesDowntime | AffectsMoreThanOneTeam | HasRollbackPlan | IsStandardChange

Compose_Score
  add(
    if(triggerBody()?['AffectsProduction'], 2, 0),
    add(
      if(triggerBody()?['CausesDowntime'], 3, 0),
      add(
        if(triggerBody()?['AffectsMoreThanOneTeam'], 2, 0),
        if(triggerBody()?['HasRollbackPlan'], 0, 2)
      )
    )
  )

Compose_Impact
  if(and(triggerBody()?['IsStandardChange'], less(outputs('Compose_Score'), 3)), 'Standard',
  if(greaterOrEquals(outputs('Compose_Score'), 5), 'Major', 'Normal'))

Update item   Impact = @{outputs('Compose_Impact')}, ImpactScore = @{outputs('Compose_Score')}

Switch on outputs('Compose_Impact')
  Standard : Update item Status = Approved, ApprovalNote = Pre-approved standard change
  Normal   : Approval (first to respond) -> service owner
  Major    : Approval (everyone must approve) -> change board members
             Details include downtime window and rollback plan

Any rejection: Status = Rejected with comments. Otherwise Status = Approved, then notify the requester and the service desk.

