send-teams-cards-for-new-high-priority-i.formulaOrCode:
Trigger: When an item is created (Issues)
  Trigger condition: @equals(triggerBody()?['Priority']?['Value'], 'High')

Post adaptive card and wait for a response   (Flow bot, Channel)
{
  "type": "AdaptiveCard",
  "$schema": "http://adaptivecards.io/schemas/adaptive-card.json",
  "version": "1.4",
  "body": [
    { "type": "TextBlock", "text": "High priority issue", "weight": "Bolder", "color": "Attention", "size": "Medium" },
    { "type": "TextBlock", "text": "@{triggerBody()?['Title']}", "wrap": true, "weight": "Bolder" },
