    { "type": "Action.OpenUrl", "title": "Open issue", "url": "@{triggerBody()?['{Link}']}" }
  ]
}
  Update message : Taken by the person who responded. Open the issue for details.
  Settings > Timeout : PT2H

Update item (run after: is successful)
  AssignedTo Claims : @{body('Post_adaptive_card_and_wait_for_a_response')?['responder']?['userPrincipalName']}
  Status            : In progress

Escalate (run after: has timed out)
